  "description": "The button colour palette of Portico blocks (DEV-658): eight names, a solid fill with white text in the light theme and a pale fill with dark text in the dark theme. The plugin accepts exactly these names for a button's `color`; the app, the card and the panel draw them. Kept equal to the app copy (core/src/test/resources/palette_v1.json in gsasha/portico-app) by tests on each side. Each text:fill ratio is at least 4.5 and each fill:page ratio at least 3 (WCAG 2.x), on #FFFFFF in light and on #121212 and #1c1c1c in dark; tests/test_palette.py recomputes them.",
